# Hermes rules

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md` (binding rules) and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
Each site's fetching and parsing live in its own provider under
`ha-addon/app/hermes/providers/`; the monitor (`monitor/`) stays
site-independent. Run `sh tools/check.sh` before every release.
